LUMA SUMMARY:
Sir-Tech Chapter Two. Cozmo continues the story with the Regents/exam-school episode, his mother’s intervention, the trip to Ogdensburg, and the astonishing arrangement that gave him housing, food, a stipend, and access to Sir-Tech with effectively no formal job description. The chapter closes on the reveal that he was simply Robert’s responsibility.
